Case 5: the same join order for both FROM lists (the outer is p)     

===================================================
count(*)    
3000     

Query plan:
hash-join (inner join)
    edge:  term[?]
    outer: sscan
               class: p node[?]
               cost:  ? card ?
    inner: sscan
               class: q node[?]
               cost:  ? card ?
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
select count(*) from t?_p p, t?_q q where p.k=q.k
